PLACEMENT / SELECTION (WebViewUpdater.java:261-277 walks providers in XML DOCUMENT ORDER with no
sort; :285-315 then returns Settings.Global.WEBVIEW_PROVIDER if set, else the FIRST valid entry
marked availableByDefault):
  * To make Google WebView the automatic choice after boot, put the new <webviewprovider> element
    BEFORE the existing com.android.webview element, or
  * leave the order alone and set the key after boot:
      adb shell settings put global webview_provider com.google.android.webview
